  <data name="Settings_DevContainers_Registry_Help.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Node/npm-based Dev Container features fetch packages from the public npm registry, which some corporate networks block. Set a registry or proxy URL here and it will be injected into feature builds as NPM_CONFIG_REGISTRY. Leave blank to use each feature's default.</value>
