  <data name="Settings_Ai_QuickStart_Help.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>One click sets up Ollama in an app-managed container, downloads a model if you need one, and selects it as your provider.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Settings_Ai_WhatSetup_Header.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>What setup does</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Settings_Ai_WhatSetup_P1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Setup manages only the app's own container on 127.0.0.1 and reuses an Ollama image already on this machine. It never adopts unrelated runtimes.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Settings_Ai_WhatSetup_P2.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>If no model is installed, setup offers to download one and asks first. You can pick a different model below at any time.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Settings_Ai_WhatSetup_P3.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>GPU acceleration and model capabilities are never assumed; setup checks what the model supports and tells you the result.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Settings_Ai_SetupOllama.Text" xml:space="preserve">
